                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A solid educational adventure that presents Viking era history through exploration, decision making, and story progression. Historical themes such as trade, faith, and social change are woven into the journey in a way that remains accessible and easy to follow. The setting provides a useful introduction to the period without feeling like a textbook.\n\nQuest objectives, conversations, and small activities create a steady sense of progress. Historical details are integrated into gameplay through exploration, trading, and identifying anachronisms. A variety of tasks helps maintain interest while reinforcing historical concepts. The 3D world also adds context to locations and events.\n\nThe combination of learning and interactive storytelling works well. Clear objectives, straightforward mechanics, and an engaging historical setting make the experience enjoyable for both younger audiences and adults interested in history. An effective example of educational design that remains entertaining from beginning to end.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1791150292,
